---
// src/components/WhyStegg.astro
---

<section id="why-stegg" class="w-full py-24 md:py-32 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-200/50 scroll-mt-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        
        <div class="text-center mb-16 md:mb-20">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 mb-6 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">Built differently.</h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium leading-relaxed">
                We don't use templates or heavy page builders. Every Stegg site is engineered from the ground up for raw performance, security, and ROI.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            
            <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_25px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group">
                <div class="relative w-16 h-16 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-500">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2563EB]/30 to-sky-300/30 rounded-2xl transform rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Sub-Second Speed</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium text-lg">
                    Your customers won't wait. We hand-code our sites to load instantly, preventing ad budget waste from high mobile bounce rates.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_25px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group">
                <div class="relative w-16 h-16 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-500">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2563EB]/30 to-sky-300/30 rounded-2xl transform rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i data-lucide="feather" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Zero Bloatware</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium text-lg">
                    No Wix. No WordPress. No heavy plugins. We strip away the unnecessary code that drags down your search rankings.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_25px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group">
                <div class="relative w-16 h-16 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-500">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2563EB]/30 to-sky-300/30 rounded-2xl transform rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Enterprise Security</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium text-lg">
                    Say goodbye to cheap, vulnerable shared hosting. We deploy your site on world-class infrastructure so you never have to worry about hacks or downtime.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-[0_25px_50px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 group relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-[#2563EB]/5 blur-[40px] rounded-full pointer-events-none group-hover:bg-[#2563EB]/10 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
                
                <div class="relative w-16 h-16 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-500 z-10">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2563EB]/30 to-sky-300/30 rounded-2xl transform rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white shadow-[0_4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i data-lucide="target" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight relative z-10">pSEO Architecture</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium text-lg relative z-10">
                    Built-in Programmatic SEO logic. We structure your site to automatically capture local search traffic without expensive monthly retainers.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>